id           = CWE-1094
name         = Excessive Index Range Scan for a Data Resource
abstraction  = Base
structure    = Simple
status       = Incomplete

description : The product contains an index range scan for a large data table, but the scan can cover a large number of rows.

extended description : While the interpretation of "large data table" and "excessive index range" may vary for each product or developer, CISQ recommends a threshold of 1000000 table rows and a threshold of 10 for the index range.

notes : https://cwe.mitre.org/data/definitions/1094.html
